1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,780
Bugungi videoda nima haqida? Yapon tilini oʻrganishning birinchi qadami.

2
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:09,780
1-qism: Tanishuv va kompaniya taqdimoti

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,049
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

4
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:14,948
Men Tanaka.

5
00:00:14,971 --> 00:00:16,805
Tanishganimdan xursandman.

6
00:00:16,828 --> 00:00:19,642
Men Suzuki.

7
00:00:19,665 --> 00:00:23,432
Suzuki-san, siz bu kompaniyada ishlaysizmi?

8
00:00:23,455 --> 00:00:25,096
Ha.

9
00:00:25,119 --> 00:00:28,488
Bugundan boshlab bu kompaniyada ishlayman.

10
00:00:28,511 --> 00:00:31,678
Men ham bu kompaniyada ishlayman.

11
00:00:31,701 --> 00:00:35,501
Suzuki-san, kimning kichik hamkasbisiz?

12
00:00:35,524 --> 00:00:39,357
Men Sato-sanning kichik hamkasbisiman.

13
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,514
Sato-sanning joyi qayerda?

14
00:00:42,537 --> 00:00:46,503
Sato-sanning joyi u yerda.

15
00:00:46,526 --> 00:00:49,593
Derazaning yonidagi joy.

16
00:00:49,617 --> 00:00:51,225
Ana u joymi?

17
00:00:51,249 --> 00:00:53,264
Rahmat.

18
00:00:53,287 --> 00:00:56,360
Bu Tanaka-sanning tashrif qogʻozimi?

19
00:00:56,384 --> 00:00:58,068
Ha.

20
00:00:58,092 --> 00:01:01,132
Bu mening tashrif qogʻozim.

21
00:01:01,156 --> 00:01:03,006
Marhamat.

22
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:04,866
Rahmat.

23
00:01:04,890 --> 00:01:07,856
Bu Tanaka-sanning daftarimi?

24
00:01:07,879 --> 00:01:09,913
Yoʻq.

25
00:01:09,936 --> 00:01:13,275
Bu mening daftarim emas.

26
00:01:13,298 --> 00:01:15,764
Suzuki-sanning daftarimi?

27
00:01:15,787 --> 00:01:17,287
Ha.

28
00:01:17,311 --> 00:01:19,117
Bu.

29
00:01:19,140 --> 00:01:22,382
Bu mening daftarim.

30
00:01:22,406 --> 00:01:25,825
Qabulxonadagi daftar ham Suzuki-sanningmi?

31
00:01:25,848 --> 00:01:27,915
Yoʻq.

32
00:01:27,938 --> 00:01:30,983
Qabulxonadagi daftar Sato-sanning.

33
00:01:31,006 --> 00:01:32,866
Shundaymi.

34
00:01:32,889 --> 00:01:36,089
Suzuki-san, necha yoshdasiz?

35
00:01:36,113 --> 00:01:39,146
Men 25 yoshdaman.

36
00:01:39,169 --> 00:01:42,202
Tanaka-san ham 25 yoshdami?

37
00:01:42,225 --> 00:01:44,159
Yoʻq.

38
00:01:44,182 --> 00:01:46,982
Men 28 yoshdaman.

39
00:01:47,005 --> 00:01:49,538
Tanaka-san katta hamkasbingiz ekan.

40
00:01:49,561 --> 00:01:52,795
Ha, shunday.

41
00:01:52,819 --> 00:01:55,752
Suzuki-sanning kompyuteri qaysi?

42
00:01:55,775 --> 00:01:59,242
Mening kompyuterim bu.

43
00:01:59,265 --> 00:02:02,637
Suzuki-sanning joyi mana shu yerda.

44
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,502
Marhamat.

45
00:02:04,525 --> 00:02:05,692
Ha.

46
00:02:05,715 --> 00:02:08,248
Rahmat.

47
00:02:08,271 --> 00:02:15,376
Bugungi videoni takrorlash uchun sayt havolasini tavsif va eng yaxshi kommentariyda topishingiz mumkin. *Sayt oldindan ogohlantirmasdan oʻchirilishi mumkin.

48
00:02:15,376 --> 00:02:18,376
2-qism: Egalik va tegishli narsalar: Kitoblar va daftarlar

49
00:02:18,376 --> 00:02:22,752
Suzuki-san, bu qanday kitob?

50
00:02:22,776 --> 00:02:24,543
Bu kitobmi?

51
00:02:24,566 --> 00:02:28,345
Bu yapon tilidagi kitob.

52
00:02:28,369 --> 00:02:31,102
Bu kimning kitobi?

53
00:02:31,125 --> 00:02:33,740
Suzuki-sanning kitobimi?

54
00:02:33,763 --> 00:02:38,411
Yoʻq, bu mening kitobim emas.

55
00:02:38,435 --> 00:02:40,614
Kutubxonaning kitobi.

56
00:02:40,637 --> 00:02:43,071
Kutubxonaning kitobimi?

57
00:02:43,094 --> 00:02:44,960
Ha.

58
00:02:44,983 --> 00:02:48,183
Tanaka-sanning daftari qaysi?

59
00:02:48,206 --> 00:02:51,478
Mening daftarim bu.

60
00:02:51,501 --> 00:02:54,337
Bu koʻk daftar.

61
00:02:54,361 --> 00:02:57,694
Bu ruchka ham Tanakasanikimi?

62
00:02:57,717 --> 00:02:58,795
Ha.

63
00:02:58,819 --> 00:03:01,985
Bu ruchka ham mening ruchkam.

64
00:03:02,008 --> 00:03:04,654
Suzukisaning ruchkasi qayerda?

65
00:03:04,678 --> 00:03:08,377
Mening ruchkam shu yerda.

66
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:10,417
Lugʻatning ustida.

67
00:03:10,441 --> 00:03:12,850
A, mana bu yerda ekan.

68
00:03:12,874 --> 00:03:16,274
Bu ingliz tili lugʻatimi?

69
00:03:16,297 --> 00:03:18,578
Bu yapon tili lugʻati?

70
00:03:18,601 --> 00:03:21,734
U yapon tili lugʻati.

71
00:03:21,757 --> 00:03:24,558
Bu lugʻat qancha turadi?

72
00:03:24,582 --> 00:03:28,277
U lugʻat 3000 yen.

73
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:30,974
3000 yenmi?

74
00:03:30,998 --> 00:03:33,080
Ana u nima?

75
00:03:33,103 --> 00:03:36,397
U stol ustidagi narsa.

76
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:39,220
U soat.

77
00:03:39,243 --> 00:03:41,936
Satosanning soati.

78
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:46,207
U soat ham yapon tili maktabining narsasimi?

79
00:03:46,230 --> 00:03:51,235
Yoʻq, u maktabniki emas.

80
00:03:51,259 --> 00:03:53,592
U Satosanning narsasi.

81
00:03:53,615 --> 00:03:55,381
Shundaymi.

82
00:03:55,404 --> 00:03:58,581
Ushbu xonaning kaliti qayerda?

83
00:03:58,605 --> 00:04:01,844
Xonaning kaliti shu yerda.

84
00:04:01,868 --> 00:04:04,148
Stolning ichida.

85
00:04:04,172 --> 00:04:06,538
Tushunarli.

86
00:04:06,561 --> 00:04:08,695
Rahmat.

87
00:04:08,718 --> 00:04:17,263
Eshitganingizni izohda yozing.

88
00:04:17,263 --> 00:04:20,263
3-Sahna: Bekatdagi yoʻl-yoʻriq va chiptalarni sotib olish

89
00:04:20,263 --> 00:04:21,917
Kechirasiz.

90
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:24,794
Bekatdagi hojatxona qayerda?

91
00:04:24,818 --> 00:04:28,106
Hojatxona ana u yerda.

92
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:30,896
Doʻkonning yonida.

93
00:04:30,919 --> 00:04:32,930
Ana u yerda ekan.

94
00:04:32,954 --> 00:04:35,287
Rahmat.

95
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:38,477
Chipta kassasi qayerda?

96
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:42,079
Chipta kassasi shu yerda.

97
00:04:42,103 --> 00:04:44,281
Bu kassa.

98
00:04:44,304 --> 00:04:46,671
Shu yerda?

99
00:04:46,694 --> 00:04:50,060
Tokyoga chipta qancha turadi?

100
00:04:50,083 --> 00:04:53,850
Tokyoga chipta 160 yen.

101
00:04:53,873 --> 00:04:57,406
160 yenmi?

102
00:04:57,429 --> 00:05:01,196
Suzukisaning chiptasi ham 160 yenmi?

103
00:05:01,219 --> 00:05:06,598
Yoʻq, mening chiptam 160 yen emas.

104
00:05:06,621 --> 00:05:09,188
190 yen.

105
00:05:09,211 --> 00:05:11,144
Shundaymi.

106
00:05:11,167 --> 00:05:14,051
Axborot byurosi qayerda?

107
00:05:14,075 --> 00:05:16,875
Axborot byurosi ana u tomonda.

108
00:05:16,898 --> 00:05:19,745
Janubiy chiqishning yonida.

109
00:05:19,768 --> 00:05:22,041
Ana u tomonda ekan.

110
00:05:22,065 --> 00:05:25,081
U bino nima?

111
00:05:25,104 --> 00:05:28,386
U bekat mehmonxonasi.

112
00:05:28,410 --> 00:05:33,143
U mehmonxona yapon kompaniyasiniki?

113
00:05:33,166 --> 00:05:37,566
Ha, yapon kompaniyasiniki.

114
00:05:37,589 --> 00:05:40,522
Suzukisaning kompaniyasi qayerda?

115
00:05:40,545 --> 00:05:43,779
Mening kompaniyam shu yerda.

116
00:05:43,802 --> 00:05:45,768
Vokzal ichida.

117
00:05:45,791 --> 00:05:48,438
Vokzal ichidami?

118
00:05:48,462 --> 00:05:50,462
Qulay ekan.

119
00:05:50,485 --> 00:05:54,091
Ha, juda qulay.

120
00:05:54,115 --> 00:05:57,081
Tanaka-san, maktabingiz qayerda?

121
00:05:57,104 --> 00:06:00,038
Maktabim ana u yerda.

122
00:06:00,061 --> 00:06:03,479
Ana o'sha binoning uchinchi qavatida.

123
00:06:03,502 --> 00:06:05,998
A, ana o'sha bino ekan.

124
00:06:06,021 --> 00:06:08,421
Ha, shunday.

125
00:06:08,444 --> 00:06:11,444
Sahna 4: Yig'ilish va Ish Jadvali / Yig'ilish va Ish Rejasi

126
00:06:11,444 --> 00:06:16,778
Suzuki-san, ertangi yig'ilish soat nechadan boshlanadi?

127
00:06:16,801 --> 00:06:22,267
Ertangi yig'ilish soat 10 dan 12 gacha.

128
00:06:22,290 --> 00:06:24,372
Saat 10 dan boshlanadi, shundaymi?

129
00:06:24,396 --> 00:06:26,997
Joyi qayerda?

130
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:30,786
Yig'ilish xonasi uchinchi qavatda.

131
00:06:30,809 --> 00:06:35,043
Hujjatlar stol ustida ko'p.

132
00:06:35,066 --> 00:06:36,755
Rahmat.

133
00:06:36,778 --> 00:06:40,464
Bugun tushdan keyin ish bormi?

134
00:06:40,488 --> 00:06:46,154
Ha, bugun tushdan keyin soat 1 dan 5 gacha ishlayman.

135
00:06:46,177 --> 00:06:51,511
Har kuni necha soat ishlaysiz?

136
00:06:51,534 --> 00:06:54,667
Har kuni 8 soat ishlayman.

137
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:59,123
Tanaka-san, kecha necha soatgacha ishladingiz?

138
00:06:59,147 --> 00:07:03,834
Kecha soat 9 gacha ishladim.

139
00:07:03,857 --> 00:07:06,277
Saat 9 gachami?

140
00:07:06,300 --> 00:07:08,379
Qiyin bo'lgan ekan.

141
00:07:08,403 --> 00:07:13,403
Ha. Ammo bugun kechqurun ishlamayman.

142
00:07:13,426 --> 00:07:16,633
Bugun kechqurun dam olasizmi?

143
00:07:16,656 --> 00:07:19,889
Ha, dam olaman.

144
00:07:19,912 --> 00:07:25,205
Suzuki-san, bugun kechqurun birga ovqatlanamizmi?

145
00:07:25,229 --> 00:07:27,029
Yaxshi.

146
00:07:27,052 --> 00:07:29,462
Qayerda ovqatlanamiz?

147
00:07:29,486 --> 00:07:32,886
Vokzal oldidagi restoranda ovqatlanamiz.

148
00:07:32,909 --> 00:07:35,743
Necha soatda restoranga boramiz?

149
00:07:35,767 --> 00:07:38,200
Soat 7 da boramiz.

150
00:07:38,223 --> 00:07:40,708
Mashinada boramizmi?

151
00:07:40,731 --> 00:07:43,665
Yo'q, elektr poyezdda boramiz.

152
00:07:43,688 --> 00:07:45,526
Tushunarli.

153
00:07:45,549 --> 00:07:49,282
Unda, soat 7 da restoran oldida.

154
00:07:49,305 --> 00:07:51,958
Ha, kechqurun ko'rishamiz.

155
00:07:51,981 --> 00:07:54,981
Sahna 5: Univermagga boring / Univermagga boringlar

156
00:07:54,981 --> 00:07:59,070
Suzuki-san, ertaga qaysi kun?

157
00:07:59,094 --> 00:08:03,148
Ertaga shanba.

158
00:08:03,171 --> 00:08:06,374
A, shanbami?

159
00:08:06,398 --> 00:08:10,249
Univermag nechadan ochiladi?

160
00:08:10,272 --> 00:08:15,272
Univermag ertalab soat 10 dan ochiladi.

161
00:08:15,295 --> 00:08:18,462
Kechasi soat 8 gacha.

162
00:08:18,485 --> 00:08:21,365
Saat 10 dan boshlanadi, shundaymi?

163
00:08:21,389 --> 00:08:26,271
Univermag ichida sumka do'koni bormi?

164
00:08:26,294 --> 00:08:32,752
Ha, ikkinchi qavatda sumka do'konlari ko'p.

165
00:08:32,776 --> 00:08:37,176
Kiyim va poyabzal do'konlari ham bor.

166
00:08:37,199 --> 00:08:39,418
Yaxshi.

167
00:08:39,441 --> 00:08:44,487
Ertaga ertalab univermagga boramizmi?

168
00:08:44,511 --> 00:08:46,522
Yaxshi.

169
00:08:46,545 --> 00:08:49,278
Birga boring.

170
00:08:49,301 --> 00:08:51,834
Necha soatda uchrashamiz?

171
00:08:51,857 --> 00:08:57,116
Ertalab soat 9:50 da vokzalda uchrashamiz.

172
00:08:57,140 --> 00:08:59,873
Soat toʻqqiz ellik.

173
00:08:59,896 --> 00:09:03,429
Nima uchun univermagga boramiz?

174
00:09:03,452 --> 00:09:06,452
Avtobusda boraylik.

175
00:09:06,475 --> 00:09:10,114
Avtobus bekatı vokzal oldida joylashgan.

176
00:09:10,137 --> 00:09:12,108
Tushunarli.

177
00:09:12,132 --> 00:09:17,132
Kecha UI qayerda xarid qildi?

178
00:09:17,155 --> 00:09:23,189
Kecha supermarketda sabzavot va mevalar sotib oldim.

179
00:09:23,213 --> 00:09:27,379
Suzuki-san, kecha nima xarid qildingiz?

180
00:09:27,402 --> 00:09:31,890
Men kecha hech narsa sotib olmadim.

181
00:09:31,913 --> 00:09:34,317
Shundaymi.

182
00:09:34,341 --> 00:09:38,875
Unda, ertaga koʻp narsa xarid qilaylik.

183
00:09:38,898 --> 00:09:40,737
Ha.

184
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:45,194
Ertaga bir soat davomida xarid qilamizmi?

185
00:09:45,217 --> 00:09:50,383
Yoʻq, uch soat davomida xarid qilaylik.

186
00:09:50,406 --> 00:09:52,659
Uch soatmi?

187
00:09:52,683 --> 00:09:55,883
Koʻp yuramiz, shundaymi?

188
00:09:55,906 --> 00:09:59,473
Ha, yuraylik.

189
00:09:59,496 --> 00:10:02,496
6-SAHNA: Oʻqish va Imtihon Haqida / Oʻqish va Imtihon Toʻgʻrisida Suhbat

190
00:10:02,496 --> 00:10:07,948
Suzuki-san, kecha kechqurun oʻqidingizmi?

191
00:10:07,972 --> 00:10:14,984
Ha, kecha kechqurun ikki soat yapon tilini oʻqidim.

192
00:10:15,007 --> 00:10:18,974
Tanaka-san, necha soat oʻqidingiz?

193
00:10:18,997 --> 00:10:25,230
Men kecha kechqurun umuman oʻqimadim.

194
00:10:25,253 --> 00:10:27,943
Shundaymi?

195
00:10:27,966 --> 00:10:31,533
Kecha imtihon qanday boʻldi?

196
00:10:31,556 --> 00:10:35,156
Imtihon soat oʻnlarda boshlandi.

197
00:10:35,179 --> 00:10:40,413
Imtihon xonasida soat bor edi mi?

198
00:10:40,436 --> 00:10:46,070
Yoʻq, xonada soat yoʻq edi.

199
00:10:46,093 --> 00:10:50,026
Shundaymi? Noqulay boʻldi-ku.

200
00:10:50,049 --> 00:10:54,735
Bugun tushdan keyin kutubxonada oʻqishmasmi?

201
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:57,492
Bugun tushdan keyinmi?

202
00:10:57,515 --> 00:11:01,682
Soat birdan toʻrtgacha kutubxonada boʻlaman.

203
00:11:01,705 --> 00:11:04,518
Birga oʻqiyapmiz.

204
00:11:04,541 --> 00:11:08,954
Kutubxonada lugʻatlar bormi?

205
00:11:08,977 --> 00:11:15,822
Ha, stol ustida koʻp yaponcha lugʻatlar bor.

206
00:11:15,846 --> 00:11:18,180
Kompyuterlar ham bormi?

207
00:11:18,203 --> 00:11:22,536
Ha, beshta kompyuter ham bor.

208
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:24,611
Yaxshi.

209
00:11:24,635 --> 00:11:27,677
Nima bilan kutubxonaga boramiz?

210
00:11:27,700 --> 00:11:30,519
Velosipedda boraman.

211
00:11:30,542 --> 00:11:34,009
Suzuki-san, nima bilan borasiz?

212
00:11:34,032 --> 00:11:38,565
Men doʻstlarim bilan mashinada boraman.

213
00:11:38,588 --> 00:11:40,722
Tushunarli.

214
00:11:40,745 --> 00:11:45,011
Unda, soat birda kutubxonada koʻrishamiz.

215
00:11:45,034 --> 00:11:48,077
Ha, keyinroq koʻrishamiz.

216
00:11:48,101 --> 00:11:51,101
7-SAHNA: Ish Tugashi Va Dam olish Kunlari Rejalari / Ish Tugash Vaqti Va Dam olish Kunlari Rejalari

217
00:11:51,101 --> 00:11:54,793
Suzuki-san, juma oqshomi ekan-ku.

218
00:11:54,817 --> 00:11:58,817
Bugun soat nechada ish tugaydi?

219
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:02,378
Bugun soat oltida tugaydi.

220
00:12:02,401 --> 00:12:06,835
Tanaka-san, soat nechagacha ishlaysiz?

221
00:12:06,858 --> 00:12:11,338
Men soat besh yarimgacha ishlayman.

222
00:12:11,362 --> 00:12:14,928
Soat besh yarimda tugaydi-ku.

223
00:12:14,951 --> 00:12:16,487
Ha.

224
00:12:16,511 --> 00:12:21,160
Bu hafta har kuni koʻp ish qildik.

225
00:12:21,183 --> 00:12:23,350
Shundaymi.

226
00:12:23,373 --> 00:12:25,606
Qattiq mehnat qildingiz.

227
00:12:25,629 --> 00:12:30,196
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari rejangiz nima?

228
00:12:30,219 --> 00:12:34,253
Shanba kuni ertalab soat toʻqqizda turaman.

229
00:12:34,276 --> 00:12:38,154
Keyin doʻstlarim bilan bogʻga boramiz.

230
00:12:38,177 --> 00:12:41,178
Bogʻda nima qilasiz?

231
00:12:41,202 --> 00:12:44,180
Bogʻda tennis oʻynaymiz.

232
00:12:44,203 --> 00:12:48,536
Suzuki-san, hafta oxirida tennis oʻynaysizmi?

233
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:53,326
Yoʻq, men umuman tennis oʻynamayman.

234
00:12:53,349 --> 00:12:56,949
Yakshanba kuni kino koʻraman.

235
00:12:56,972 --> 00:12:59,805
Qayerda kino koʻrasiz?

236
00:12:59,828 --> 00:13:03,462
Shibuya kinoteatrida koʻraman.

237
00:13:03,485 --> 00:13:08,652
Tanaka-san, shanba kuni kechqurun birga kino koʻrishmaysizmi?

238
00:13:08,675 --> 00:13:11,209
Shanba kuni kechqurunmi?

239
00:13:11,232 --> 00:13:13,119
Yaxshi.

240
00:13:13,142 --> 00:13:15,549
Qaysi vaqtda kino?

241
00:13:15,572 --> 00:13:19,041
Kechki soat 7 da kino.

242
00:13:19,065 --> 00:13:21,702
Soat 7 dan 9 gacha.

243
00:13:21,725 --> 00:13:23,692
Tushunarli.

244
00:13:23,715 --> 00:13:29,315
Unda, soat 6:30 da kinoteatr oldida uchrashamiz.

245
00:13:29,338 --> 00:13:30,988
Ha.

246
00:13:31,012 --> 00:13:33,179
Poyezdda borasizmi?

247
00:13:33,202 --> 00:13:34,735
Ha.

248
00:13:34,758 --> 00:13:36,691
Metroda boraman.

249
00:13:36,714 --> 00:13:38,997
Tushunarli.

250
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:41,233
Kutishga arziydi!

251
00:13:41,257 --> 00:13:44,257
Sahna 8: Xarid qilish rejasi

252
00:13:44,257 --> 00:13:50,350
Suzuki-san, bugun kechqurun bozorga borasizmi?

253
00:13:50,373 --> 00:13:54,459
Ha, soat 5 da bozorga boraman.

254
00:13:54,483 --> 00:13:57,250
Tanaka-san ham borasizmi?

255
00:13:57,273 --> 00:14:00,888
Ha, men ham soat 5 da boraman.

256
00:14:00,912 --> 00:14:03,482
Birga boramizmi?

257
00:14:03,506 --> 00:14:05,340
Yaxshi.

258
00:14:05,363 --> 00:14:07,736
Birga boring.

259
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:10,846
Bozorda nima xarid qilasiz?

260
00:14:10,869 --> 00:14:13,902
Goʻsht va baliq xarid qilaman.

261
00:14:13,925 --> 00:14:17,259
Bugun kechki ovqat uchun.

262
00:14:17,282 --> 00:14:20,682
Goʻsht boʻlimi qayerda?

263
00:14:20,705 --> 00:14:25,582
Goʻsht boʻlimi kirish joyi yaqinida.

264
00:14:25,605 --> 00:14:29,018
Baliq boʻlimi esa ichkarida.

265
00:14:29,042 --> 00:14:30,893
Tushunarli.

266
00:14:30,916 --> 00:14:33,883
Sabzavot ham koʻpmi?

267
00:14:33,906 --> 00:14:37,676
Ha, sabzavot ham koʻp.

268
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:40,733
Kecha pomidor sotib oldim.

269
00:14:40,756 --> 00:14:43,454
Pomidor qancha turardi?

270
00:14:43,477 --> 00:14:47,077
Pomidor bitta 100 yen edi.

271
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:49,634
100 yenmi?

272
00:14:49,657 --> 00:14:51,665
Bugun ham sotib olaylik.

273
00:14:51,688 --> 00:14:56,463
Ha. Xarid qilgandan keyin qayerga boramiz?

274
00:14:56,486 --> 00:15:01,519
Xarid qilgandan keyin uyimga kelmaysizmi?

275
00:15:01,542 --> 00:15:03,742
Tanaka-san uyigami?

276
00:15:03,765 --> 00:15:05,462
Yaxshimi?

277
00:15:05,486 --> 00:15:09,419
Ha, birga ovqat pishiramiz.

278
00:15:09,442 --> 00:15:11,008
Yaxshi.

279
00:15:11,031 --> 00:15:13,643
Necha soat pishiramiz?

280
00:15:13,667 --> 00:15:16,685
1 soat atrofida pishiramiz.

281
00:15:16,709 --> 00:15:18,353
Tushunarli.

282
00:15:18,376 --> 00:15:22,376
Unda, soat 5 da bozor kirish joyida.

283
00:15:22,399 --> 00:15:24,613
Ha, soat 5 da.

284
00:15:24,637 --> 00:15:27,637
Sahna 9: Mehmonxonaga roʻyxatdan oʻtish

285
00:15:27,637 --> 00:15:29,503
Kechirasiz.

286
00:15:29,526 --> 00:15:32,560
Roʻyxatdan oʻtishni iltimos qilaman.

287
00:15:32,583 --> 00:15:33,949
Ha.

288
00:15:33,972 --> 00:15:36,906
Ismingizni aytib yuborsangiz.

289
00:15:36,928 --> 00:15:39,107
Tanaka.

290
00:15:39,131 --> 00:15:42,864
Bugundan yakshanbagacha qolaman.

291
00:15:42,887 --> 00:15:45,287
Tanaka deb atayapsiz, shundaymi?

292
00:15:45,310 --> 00:15:48,277
Bugundan boshlab ikki kecha qolasaniz, to‘g‘ri?

293
00:15:48,300 --> 00:15:51,358
Xonangiz beshinchi qavatda joylashgan.

294
00:15:51,381 --> 00:15:53,834
Beshinchi qavatda, shundaymi?

295
00:15:53,858 --> 00:15:56,891
Lift qayerda?

296
00:15:56,914 --> 00:16:00,164
Lift ana u yerda joylashgan.

297
00:16:00,187 --> 00:16:02,521
Lobbi yonida.

298
00:16:02,544 --> 00:16:04,552
Tushunarli.

299
00:16:04,575 --> 00:16:08,175
Nonushta soat nechadan nechagacha?

300
00:16:08,198 --> 00:16:14,132
Nonushta ertalab soat 7 dan 9:30 gacha.

301
00:16:14,155 --> 00:16:16,790
Birinchi qavatdagi restoranda ovqatlanasiz.

302
00:16:16,814 --> 00:16:19,447
Birinchi qavatdagi restoran, shundaymi?

303
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:23,270
Xonada choy bormi?

304
00:16:23,293 --> 00:16:24,926
Ha.

305
00:16:24,949 --> 00:16:28,727
Stolda choy va stakan bor.

306
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:32,205
Muzlatgichda suv ham bor.

307
00:16:32,229 --> 00:16:34,429
Ko‘pmi?

308
00:16:34,452 --> 00:16:37,028
Suv ikki shisha bor.

309
00:16:37,052 --> 00:16:39,018
Tushunarli.

310
00:16:39,041 --> 00:16:42,537
Mehmonxonaga yaqin bank bormi?

311
00:16:42,561 --> 00:16:43,899
Ha.

312
00:16:43,923 --> 00:16:47,217
Mehmonxona oldida bank bor.

313
00:16:47,240 --> 00:16:51,444
Pochtamt ham bank yonida joylashgan.

314
00:16:51,468 --> 00:16:55,068
Yaqin atrofdagi muzeyga qanday borish mumkin?

315
00:16:55,091 --> 00:16:58,224
Muzeyga avtobusda boring.

316
00:16:58,247 --> 00:17:01,480
Avtobus bekat mehmonxonaning o‘ng tomonida.

317
00:17:01,503 --> 00:17:03,479
Avtobusda, shundaymi?

318
00:17:03,502 --> 00:17:05,114
Rahmat.

319
00:17:05,138 --> 00:17:08,071
Endi xonaga boraman.

320
00:17:08,094 --> 00:17:09,627
Ha.

321
00:17:09,650 --> 00:17:11,696
Yaxshi dam oling.

322
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:14,720
10-SAHNA: Sport zalidan foydalanish bo‘yicha qo‘llanma

323
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:20,520
Salom, bugundan boshlab bu sport zaliga aʼzo bo‘ldim.

324
00:17:20,543 --> 00:17:24,318
Salom, men qabulxona xodimi Suzuki.

325
00:17:24,341 --> 00:17:26,541
Iltimos, yaxshi qaraymiz.

326
00:17:26,564 --> 00:17:28,771
Iltimos, yaxshi qaraymiz.

327
00:17:28,794 --> 00:17:32,331
Sport zali nechadan boshlab ochiladi?

328
00:17:32,355 --> 00:17:37,854
Ish kunlari ertalab soat 9 dan kechki 10 gacha ochiq.

329
00:17:37,877 --> 00:17:43,843
Shanba va yakshanba kunlari ertalab soat 10 dan kechki 8 gacha.

330
00:17:43,866 --> 00:17:46,441
Har kuni ochiqmi?

331
00:17:46,465 --> 00:17:50,479
Yo‘q, seshanba kuni dam olish kuni.

332
00:17:50,502 --> 00:17:52,636
Seshanba dam olish kuni.

333
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:55,271
Seshanba dam olish kuni, shundaymi?

334
00:17:55,295 --> 00:17:57,331
Tushunarli.

335
00:17:57,354 --> 00:18:00,488
Kiyim almashtirish xonasi qayerda?

336
00:18:00,511 --> 00:18:03,577
Kiyim almashtirish xonasi ikkinchi qavatda.

337
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:06,648
Dush kabinalari ham ikkinchi qavatda.

338
00:18:06,672 --> 00:18:09,238
Ikkinchi qavatda, shundaymi?

339
00:18:09,261 --> 00:18:12,028
Poyafzal qayerda qoldirish kerak?

340
00:18:12,051 --> 00:18:16,121
Poyafzalni birinchi qavatdagi kirish joyida qoldirasiz.

341
00:18:16,145 --> 00:18:18,921
Bu yerda poyafzal yechiladi.

342
00:18:18,944 --> 00:18:20,959
Shu yerda, shundaymi?

343
00:18:20,983 --> 00:18:24,600
Bugun bir soat mashq qilaman.

344
00:18:24,623 --> 00:18:26,390
Yaxshi.

345
00:18:26,413 --> 00:18:29,446
Kecha ham mashq qildingizmi?

346
00:18:29,469 --> 00:18:34,203
Yo‘q, kecha uyda televizor ko‘rdim.

347
00:18:34,226 --> 00:18:37,438
Umuman mashq qilmadim.

348
00:18:37,462 --> 00:18:39,395
Shundaymi?

349
00:18:39,418 --> 00:18:41,785
Bugundan boshlab harakat qilaylik.

350
00:18:41,808 --> 00:18:44,654
Ha, harakat qilaman.

351
00:18:44,677 --> 00:18:50,173
Sport zalida ichimliklar uchun avtomat bormi?

352
00:18:50,196 --> 00:18:53,674
Ha, qabulxonaning yonida joylashgan.

353
00:18:53,697 --> 00:18:56,778
Suv va choylar ko‘p, tanlang!

354
00:18:56,802 --> 00:18:59,136
Tushunarli.

355
00:18:59,158 --> 00:19:01,841
Endi ikkinchi qavatga boraman.

356
00:19:01,865 --> 00:19:04,484
Ha, borib keling!